+## Thresholds for CI Integration (Day 25)
+
+The evaluation harness supports optional thresholds to gate CI pipelines:
+- CLI: `frai eval --outputs <file> --threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold toxicity=0.95`
+- SDK: Pass `thresholds: { exact_match: 0.9, toxicity: 0.95 }` to `generateReport`
+- Exit codes: 0 (all pass), 1 (any fail), 2 (usage error)
+- Reports include `passed` boolean and `thresholds` array with pass/fail status per metric
+- Metrics with no score (null) fail their thresholds
+- Markdown reports include a "Thresholds" section with PASS/FAIL status
+
 ## Follow-up Tasks
 1. Integrate real toxicity/bias models once provider abstraction is implemented (Phase 0 → Providers milestone).
 2. Extend datasets loader to support configurable schema mapping.
